title: 1931
subtitle: The Republic is proclaimed
on-arrival: {!
Q.economic_growth -= 1;
if (Q.works_program) {
    Q.economic_growth += 1.5;
}
if (Q.works_program && Q.works_program > 1) {
    Q.economic_growth += 1;
}
// moved demographic changes to post_event
!}
tags: event
view-if: year = 1931 and month = 4
priority: 2
max-visits: 1

King Alfonso XIII has left the country, and the Second Spanish Republic has been proclaimed. [? if works_program = 0 : Unemployment remains high in the cities and among the landless laborers of the south. ?][? if works_program > 0 : A works program has been enacted in order to reduce unemployment. ?] [? if works_program > 0 and unemployed > 15 : However, unemployment remains too high for comfort. ?]
